    <title>Exhaust CVTC Target - Cold</title>
    <description>Exact JK00C. Address 0xB67E; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Cold/fallback exhaust-CVTC target surface. FUN 000bfdc0 writes its centered uint8 result to ffff1c5f; FUN 000bfe88 selects or blends it with warm/main result ffff1c5d and conditions the result into exhaust target ffff2327. The code path proves the exhaust-target subsystem and centered representation. The conversion follows from monitor 0008f168, which compares target ffff2327 in raw units with the actual bytes ffff2324/ffff2325 that FUN 000bfc2e writes in counts of 0.5 crank degrees relative to the learned rest edge. The precise cold/fallback operating-mode name remains a homologous candidate. Stock cells are all 128, so this surface requests neutral exhaust timing wherever selected. Result disposition: consumer. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000b2fa through JK08A-JK00C.definition-addresses.csv: cold exhaust-cam target in the stock exhaust CVTC descriptor block at 0x000C5B4C; 8x8 operand of target exhaust accessor 000c5a44 at callsite 000c5a92. Static diagnostic context: CID=1166H_T_VTC_ANGL_EX [code, nissan_family_candidate, via map evidence: writes]; ENG SPEED [code, homologous_vq35hr, via axis evidence: indexed_by].</description>
