  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5EF9" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Exhaust CVTC Target - Main</title>
    <description>Exact JK00C. Address 0xB6BE; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Warm/main exhaust-CVTC target surface. FUN 000bfdc0 interpolates it by RPM/50 and Q7 normalized BFS, optionally subtracts correction 0000ab4a, and writes ffff1c5d. FUN 000bfe88 performs coolant selection and downstream conditioning into common exhaust target ffff2327. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. The exact service-0x22 table publishes ffff2327 as DID 0x1166. Structured Nissan diagnostics name that DID T_VTC_ANGL_EX; exact control and DTC paths consume the same target in P1078/P1084 exhaust-timing-sensor and P0014/P0024 exhaust-VTC-control monitors. This closes the subsystem identity independently of map geometry. Code proves centered raw arithmetic and the conversion: FUN 000bfc2e writes actual bytes ffff2324/ffff2325 at 000bfdae as 128 plus the filtered edge deviation from the learned rest edge in counts of 0.5 crank degrees (channel-4 captures on the 3.2 us clock over the 120-degree event interval), and monitor 0008f168 forms the tracking gap clamp_u8(ffff2327 - ffff2324 + 128) at 0008f496 and 0008f4bc in the same raw units, so the target and this surface are (raw-128)*0.5 crank degrees relative to the learned rest edge. Target-vehicle replay of the warm path matches ffff2327 exactly in 26,344 of 35,807 prior-snapshot comparisons and in 4,838 of 5,366 active samples after 16 unchanged-input cycles; remaining differences are downstream mode, rate, and offset conditioning. The 2026-09-17 dashboard recordings of a Map 3 image keep both actual bytes within two counts of a target unchanged for 100 records in 98 percent of 83,229 and 34,026 samples per bank. The absolute crank-wheel origin of the learned rest edge remains open. Result disposition: writes. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000b33a through JK08A-JK00C.definition-addresses.csv: warm exhaust-cam target in the stock exhaust CVTC descriptor block at 0x000C5B4C beside the cold exhaust target and the exhaust correction table. Static diagnostic context: CID=1166H_T_VTC_ANGL_EX [code, nissan_family_candidate, via map evidence: writes]; ENG SPEED [code, homologous_vq35hr, via axis evidence: indexed_by].</description>
