  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x8238" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut</title>
    <description>Exact JK00C. Address 0x93E6; 2 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Engine-speed fuel-cut hysteresis table consumed directly by FUN 0004f282. Bit 4 of ffff2468 selects column 0 or 1; row 0 is the inclusive activation threshold and row 1 is the exclusive release boundary. Stock delay zero makes activation immediate. Active state bit 2 of ffff2497 reaches periodic index-27 coordinator 0004ed88 and contributes full global mask 0x3f. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. The active stock 2x2 cells decode to 7650/7450 RPM in column 0 and 7450/4600 RPM in column 1. Activation occurs at RPM &gt;= threshold; equality to the release value retains cut and release requires RPM below it. ROM8[00008b38]=0x63 keeps alternate words 00009356/00009358 outside the stock path. The public HR A2L catalog supplies the candidate Normal/Reverse column labels. A JK08A vehicle session on 2026-09-21 ran column 0 from the Map 3 slot copy, whose release word is 604: eight activations and eight releases of the full 0x3f mask bound the compared activation word to 612 = 7650 RPM and the release word to 604..606 = 7550..7575 RPM, and stock release word 596 cannot produce a release whose lower captured RPM word is 599..603. Column 1 and injector-terminal shutoff remain outside that measurement. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000934e through JK08A-JK00C.definition-addresses.csv: target literals and reviewed homologous consumer topology.</description>
