  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xEE66" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 2 - Intake CVTC Target - Main</title>
    <description>Exact JK00C. Address 0xDF400; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Warm/main intake-cam target surface. FUN 000bda64 interpolates it by RPM/50 byte ffff11ae and Q7 normalized-BFS scheduler snapshot ffff102c, optionally applies conditional correction 0000ab5a around raw center 128, and writes ffff1c5c. FUN 000bdc66 uses it above raw coolant 131 and blends it with cold target 0000b53a between raw coolant 106 and 131 before the result enters the intake CVTC target path. Common-definition Map 2 storage is projected from 0xB7BE. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The intake-cam target identity is code-proven by its placement in two-channel CVTC dispatcher 000bd170, the coolant target selector, and the consumer that compares common reference ffff2326 with both intake-cam timing channels. A 35,808-sample target-vehicle replay validates the exact warm raw lookup, normalized-BFS coordinate, byte-interpolation order, and scheduler alignment. With downstream neutralization excluded, prior-snapshot alignment is exact for 32,256 of 33,839 comparisons and within one raw for 33,122. One count is 0.5 crank degrees: channel-1A capture handlers 0002a5cc and 0002a36a form the intake edge phases ffff22cc/ffff22cd as 20*ffff13b2 + floor(20*interval/ffff22bc) minus 60 or 20 through signed divider 00021bbc, where ffff22bc is 10 crank degrees; FUN 000bd9f0 publishes the actual bytes ffff2442/ffff2443 as 128 + rest edge - edge phase, and FUN 0004d2a6 subtracts them from common target ffff2326 in the same raw units. The 2026-09-17 dashboard recordings keep both actual intake bytes within two counts of a target unchanged for 100 records in 95 to 100 percent of 13,202 to 43,264 samples per bank. The Cylinder Filling physical name and the crank-wheel origin of the absolute angle remain open. Result disposition: consumer. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000b43a through JK08A-JK00C.definition-addresses.csv: warm intake-cam target in the stock intake CVTC descriptor block at 0x000C386C beside the cold intake target and the intake correction table. Static diagnostic context: ENG SPEED [code, homologous_vq35hr, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
