    <description>Exact JK00C. Address 0xE0669; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Minimum Rolling Launch ignition-retard ramp width below the captured fuel-cut threshold At activation, the runtime computes effective_ramp = min(rpm_offset, max(configured_minimum, 2*effective_hysteresis)). Mode 2 keeps the stock command at or below max(captured_rpm, Cut - effective_ramp), blends toward the per-map late-command cap inside the band, and applies the cap at Cut.</description>
